{
  "id": 490967205,
  "iid": 25192,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "ieee80211: Add dissector for Belden vendor specific IE",
  "description": "## Summary\n\nThis pull request adds support for decoding a Belden vendor-specific Information Element (IE) contained within IEEE 802.11 Beacon frames.\n\nThe Belden vendor-specific IE contains the configured Access Point (AP) name, which is currently displayed only as raw vendor data. This enhancement parses the Belden-specific payload and exposes the AP name as a readable field in the packet details view.\n\n## Background\n\nBelden wireless infrastructure devices include optional a vendor-specific Information Element in Beacon management frames. The element uses Belden's OUI and carries device configured AP name.\n\n[belden-device-name.pcapng](/uploads/bed8226de3df5699af26c93be8af679f/belden-device-name.pcapng)",
  "state": "merged",
  "created_at": "2026-06-01T15:30:44.419Z",
